+# Hey Mimi Pro v9 — YouTube Mini PiP: choose videos reliably
+
+- Version 1.1.12 / versionCode 310.
+- When Mini PiP is enabled, show a separate scrollable **Chọn video tiếp theo** grid.
+- Reuse only real watch links and thumbnails already present on the YouTube page, no duplicate player or fabricated video.
+- Supports desktop/mobile modern YouTube related cards, excludes the current video and duplicates.
+- When YouTube returns no suggestions, show a message and an explicit **Tìm thêm video** search field rather than a black screen.
+- Reset the chooser when exiting PiP, refresh it when YouTube loads new suggestions.
+- Android Auto/DHU real-device interaction still needs checking. Only use video display while parked and as permitted by Android Auto.
+
+## Tests
+
+```
+node --test tests/youtube-pip-chooser-pro-regression.test.cjs tests/youtube-mini-pip-scroll.test.cjs tests/youtube-cinema-ui.test.cjs tests/hey-mimi-pro-regression.test.cjs
+```
+
+## Deployment
+
+Apply the patch to the Hey Mimi Pro v8 source with `patch -p1 < HeyMimi_Pro_v9_PiP_Selector_Fix.patch`. The `.aab` requires the registered Play upload signing key; do not commit this key or password to GitHub.
